docs/research/2026-10-30-noise/codex-review-v65-round1.log:342:  3. **A comparison the company, a partner or a third party publishes** ("10x lower cost than closed models", "40% more GPUs in the same power budget", a third party's test): the lean as put: "标准只说'对手拿来和本公司比'的要按 5.1 判；其余的都算产品细节，不收". A partner's or customer's adoption or integration in the same sentence is still kept; ruling 4 (a competitor's 2.4x, supporting) unchanged.
